    the disclosure row. With it on the wrapper the pause button sat inside its
    own hover zone: pressing it changed nothing visible, because hover was
    already holding the outline, and a keyboard user had it worse — focusing
    the button pauses via :focus-within, so the toggle looked dead in both
    directions. The explicit control lives outside the implicit one now.
